#39750
"Path Through Bamboo Forest"
"Overhanging bamboo stalks shade the path, which runs east and west between the

closely growing fingers of bamboo.  Grass-like leaves above wave in the wind,

creating a pleasant sound.  Several stalks have fallen in the road, having

been gnawed through at the base by large teeth.  Through occasional gaps in

the bamboo, a swamp to the east can be seen.

"
