#39752
"Path Through Bamboo Forest"
"The tunnel through the bamboo continues east and west.  The path is slightly

muddy dirt, and doesn't seem to have been used for some time.  North and

south, the stalks grow so close together that you can't see a way through

them, but in some places small animal trails open up onto the road.  Wedged

into one of these trails is the half-eaten corpse of an unfortunate adventurer.

"
