#39852
"Inside an Ancient Guard Tower"
"This small room has not had regular visitors for a long time.  A thin layer of

dust lies on the granite floor and sparse furnishings, dampening any sounds

and giving the room a sombre air.  A small weapons rack stands against the

ancient wall to the north, covered in cobwebs.  In the southwest corner is a

small table with a couple of stools, one of which is missing a leg and tilted

at an odd angle.  The wall to the south was once home to a door, but it has

been broken off at the hinges leaving a door-shaped gap.  Bamboo crowds the

gap in the wall, forming an impenetrable barrier.  A small ladder leads up in

the center of the room, disappearing through a hole in the stone roof above.

"
