#39854
"Giant Bamboo - Clearing"
"The ground here is muddy and soft, having been trampled by something

incredibly heavy in the recent past.  Small tufts of grass are the only

vegetation that has managed to survive in the clearing, save for a few hardy

shoots of bamboo.  Thick walls of giant green bamboo block passage and sight

in all directions, although some of the bamboo in each direction has been

trampled; something large enough to push aside or step over the bamboo lives

here.

